/* The walkthrough that leads to the shortcut of the quick preset's service (ServiceShortcut.swift,
   Views/ShortcutGuideSheet.swift, the Settings window's line). The last group are the words the drawings put on
   the panes they stand for: they are macOS's own words, so they read as macOS shows them in each language. The
   empty shortcut field of the drawn services list says "없음" through the entry the preset editor's grouping
   already has; no step tells the user to look for that word (⑤ names the field instead), so a casing of
   macOS's own that differs cannot send anyone hunting for the wrong text. */
